// distant-rhapsody — романтический оркестр 2 in E♭ major, 69 BPM. Generated by MathMusic
// (style romantic2, seed 1): introduction → theme II → theme → storm → nocturne → finale → coda.
// Themes: A — ноктюрн в духе Шопена (recomposed), B — канон, половинные (ornamented); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from meow. Computed parts: an improvised solo, a counter-melody from the chords, the theme at half speed in the outro, a key change up.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
